OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry with
OL,6,Fthe odd bright spell but cloud will
OL,7,Fsoon thicken and rain will follow from
OL,8,Fmid-morning, reaching Caithness by
OL,9,Fearly afternoon. The rain will begin
OL,10,Fto clear from the west from the late
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with rain in the east
OL,14,Fduring the evening but dry in the
OL,15,Fwest. The rain will clear east by the
OL,16,Flate evening, leaving increasing clear
OL,17,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
