OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FCloudy but dry at first.
OL,6,FOutbreaks of rain, heavy at times,
OL,7,Fspread east later in the morning. The
OL,8,Fwind will strengthen from the morning,
OL,9,Freaching gale to severe gale later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,12,Fwindy with severe gales and locally
OL,13,Fheavy showers Sunday. Dry and bright
OL,14,Fmorning Monday, becoming windy with
OL,15,Frain later. Very windy with showers,
OL,16,Fsome heavy, Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
